<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">2 K'orontos</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 K'orontos</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 K'orontos Ashwots Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 K'or.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Gitl Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">K'orontos Ashuwots Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awlos K'orontos ashuwotssh b́ guut'ts gitlts wosho b́guut'e K'orontosn teshts Ik'i moowunton teshts ayidek't kic'its gonkewora b́tesh. Ik'i meyitsi ashuwots mangts k'efuwotsi biyats botuziyalor P'awlos mano woshosh eents shuno b́detstsok'oniye b́kitsiri, manan b́wotor een geneúwo bísh shiyewo b́falituwok'oniye b́kitsiri.</para>
  <para style="ip">B́ wosh shintsi kayatse P'awlos K'orontositse teshts Ik'i moowunton b́detsts gonkewo kitst Ik'i maamanitse tuuts gac'ewonat t k'efoon eegosh t'engidek't boosh bíaanitsok'oni b́kitsir. Manton deshidek't b́fayman boon naandrone etonat t mano maants b́ jiishtsotse bísh shiyeets gene'úwo boosh b́kitsiri. Manats dabtnuwere Yhuditse fa'a krstiyaniwotsi tep'osh tewudi dowon boimetuwok'o boosh b́gawiyiri. B́ s'uwaatsi k'ot'uwotsatsnowere woshets b́woti jangosh t'intsets s'aamiyetsi jangosha aani b́dek'ir. K'orontositsi Ik'i moowutse ash ik ikuwots botoko ari woshetswotsi woshde't P'awlosi kooti wosheke ett bos'aamifo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Shinshintsoni 1:1-11</para>
  <para style="io1">P'awlosnat t K'orontositsi Ik'i mowun 1:12—7:16</para>
  <para style="io1">Yhuditse fa'a krstiyaniwots gizi tep'o 8:1—9:15</para>
  <para style="io1">P'awlos woshets woti alo b́ wottsok'osh aani b́dek'oko 10:1—13:10</para>
  <para style="io1">B́ jamon 13:11-14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:1">Wosh. 18:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik' ettsok'on Iyesus Krstossh wosheets wottso P'awlosnat no eshuu T'imotiyosoke.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">K'orontos kitotse fa'a Ik' moonat Akayiyin fa'a Krstiyani wotts ash jamwotssh.<verse eid="2CO 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2"/>No nihi Ik'oke, no doonz Iyesus Krstosoknowere s'aatonat jeenon itsh wotowe.<verse eid="2CO 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Ik'osh b́t'intsts údo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3"/>Maarts nihonat kup' jam imet Izar Izewer, no doonz Iyesus Krstos nihi Ik'osh údo wotowe, <verse eid="2CO 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4"/>Noo Ik'oke nodatsiru kúp'iyon gond bek'otse beyiru jamwotsi kúp'sho no falituwok'o Ik'o noon no gond bek' jamotse kúp'shitwe. <verse eid="2CO 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5"/>Krstos gond bek'o ayidek'at no kayidek'tsok'on hank'o Krstosn kúp'eyo ayide'er datsituwone. <verse eid="2CO 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6"/>Noo gondo nobek'or it kúp'eyonat kashon daatsitute, no nokúp'iri itwere itkup'twok'owe. Kup'han b́datsewe no ats bodets gond bek'i naari k'amoon it itned'tsoshe. <verse eid="2CO 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7"/>Noo gond bek'o it kayok'o mank'o no kúp'ono it kayituwok'o no dantsosh itatsere nodetsts jángo kúp'e.<verse eid="2CO 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1CO 15:3">1 K'or. 15:3</ref> </char>
    </note> T eshuwotso! Isiyi datskayotse no beyor no'ats bodts gond bek'o it danetuwok'o geefone, no'ats bodts gond bek'onuwere kurosh nofalitwoniyere bogo no'ats dihit b́ teshtsotse kashon beyosh nojangtso dab k'ut'dek're b́ teshi. <verse eid="2CO 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9"/>Mank'o k'iro no'ats angshetsok'owe noosh shiyeyat b́ teshi, jaman no'ats b́ boduwere no amaniruwo k'irts tizitu Ik'ona bako no took angon b́ woterawok'o nibn no dek'ishe. <verse eid="2CO 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10"/>Mansha bí noon hank'o een k'irosh betsit t'úp'er tawatse kashire, kashitwe, dabnwere b́ kashitwok'o bíne nojágiti. <verse eid="2CO 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11"/>It noosh Ik' k'onon it tep'o geyituwe, ayi ashuwots Ik' k'onatse tuutson noosh imets Ik' s'aatosh aywots udo t'intsitune.<verse eid="2CO 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos finosh bí ettso b́wonitsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12"/>No it'et keewo haniye, hanwere ar b́ wotok'o no nibo gawitwe, k'osh ashuwotsnat bítsnooru itnton nobeets beyo Ik'oke nodek'ts S'ayinonat kááwatse tuutsone, han b́ wotuwere Ik' s'aatone b́ teshi bako ash dani telefonaliye. <verse eid="2CO 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13"/>Nababar t'iwintso it falit keewoniyere okoon k'osho eegoru guud'atsone, <verse eid="2CO 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14"/>no jangosh k'atso it dantsok'o mank'o s'eenon it danetwok'o amanitwe, manshowere doonzo Iyesus b́ weet aawor no itn noit'etuwok'o itwere noon it'etuute.<verse eid="2CO 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15"/>Keewann arik twottsosh gitoto it t'ak'ametuwok'owa etaat shin shino iti s'ilosh geeyatniye tteshi, <verse eid="2CO 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Wosh. 19:21</ref> </char></note> Itn s'ilosh tietwere Mk'odoniy datso maants it weeron t beshoronat bíyokere aanar twore b́ teshi, hank'onowere Yhud datso maantsan t sha'or taan it tep'etuwk'o gawatniye t teshi. <verse eid="2CO 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17"/>Hanowere t gawor t k'aliru danaw hake baka etirwok'o arefta itsha? Han t gawirwo iknon «ee, etonat iya'a» etaat ash gawirwok'o hake baka eton t k'altsok'o arefta itsha? <verse eid="2CO 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18"/>Ik'o amanek b́ wottsotse no nokeewirwo, «ee wee iya'a» etiru hake baka eton keeweyiru aap'ok'oyiyaliye. <verse eid="2CO 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 18:5">Wosh. 18:5</ref> </char></note> Taanat Silasn T'imotiyosu itsh nonabtso Ik' na'o Iyesus K'rstosi «ee wee iya'a» etonaliye b́teshi, ernmó ee eto bín wotere. <verse eid="2CO 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20"/>Ik'o noosh b́ jangits jamo, «ee» etiruwo Krstosne, mansh Ik' mangosh Krstosn «Amen» no etiri. <verse eid="2CO 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21"/>Noo itnton Krstosats no kúp'ituwok'o woshtso Ik'oniye, noon galdek' futtso bíne, <verse eid="2CO 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22"/>Bík nowotok'o kitsit mahatabon no'ats gedtsona shino maants noosh b́ imet gaalosh no níbots S'ayin shayiro agitok'o woshdek't imtso bíne.<verse eid="2CO 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23"/>Taa K'orontos maants aanat woo t k'azitsi jango itn tshiyanirawok'o itsh maac'o keewatniye, hansh Ik'o gawosh s'eegetwe, <verse eid="2CO 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24"/>It it imnetiyon kúp' it wottsotse it itgeneúitwok'o itnton finituwone boko it imnetiyon iti azazeratsone.<verse eid="2CO 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1"/>Eshe iti tshiyanirawok'o gawat iti s'iilo it maants ando aanar twarawok'o k'ut'dek'niye tteshi. <verse eid="2CO 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2"/>Dab iti tshiyaaniyalor ityere t shiyanitswotsiyere oko taan geneeúshituwo kone? <verse eid="2CO 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3"/>Mank'o itsh t guut'uwere itok twoor taan geneúsho boon geyit ashuwots taan boshiyanirawok'o geeyatniye, t geneúwo it únets geneúwo b́wottsok'o amanirwe. <verse eid="2CO 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4"/>Shiyani eenonat nibi kic'on, ay aac'uwonowere wotdek'at itsh tguut' ayidek'at iti tshuntsok'o itdanetwok'owa etni bako iti shiyaaniyosha etaatniyaliye.<verse eid="2CO 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dadetsosh orowa etetwok'o b́ iztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5"/>Ash shiyanitso konwor fa'e wotiyal b́shiyaniyi taan b́woterawo b́ naando k'ees'iyo wot k'aya bako k'osh weeron ititse ayuwotsnoor shiyaanire. <verse eid="2CO 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6"/>Han naari ashosh ititse ayuwots bíats boangshts fayo bísh bodfe. <verse eid="2CO 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7"/>Mansha ashaan weeralon shiyaanotse b́kindrawok'o dab maniyere bísh orowa err bín it kup'iyo itsh geyife. <verse eid="2CO 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8"/>Mank'owere bín it shuntsok'o aaniyi arikon it kiitsituwok'owo iti k'onirwe. <verse eid="2CO 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9"/>Wosh ekeewnowere itsh tguut' fadeyar jam keewon aletswotsi it woto danoosha etaatniye. <verse eid="2CO 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10"/>It bísh oorowe it eteet ashosh taawere oorowe etetuwe, bísh oorowe ti eteet naando b́beyalor taa Krstos shinatse oorowe tietet itsha erniye. <verse eid="2CO 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11"/>Man t k'alirwere shed'ani gond fino nodantsotse shed'ano noon b́ darirawk'owa etaatniye.<verse eid="2CO 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">T'iro'ad datsatse P'awlos b́kic'tsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12"/>Maniyere hakon Krstos doo shishiyo daniyosh T'iro'ad maants ti amor doonzo fini fengsho taash k'eshree, <verse eid="2CO 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12-13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 20:1">Wosh. 20:1</ref> </char></note> Ernmó t eshúwi Titoyi daatso t k'aztsotse t shayiro kash de'atse, mansh manoki krstiyaniwotsi jamiyat Mek'odoniyo maants ti ami.<verse eid="2CO 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14"/>Ernmó jam aawo Krstos da'oon noon jishirwonat sheeng sháák' detsts shituwok'o Krstossh no detsts dano jam beyok nobetsitwok'o woshtso Izar Izewersh údo wotowe! <verse eid="2CO 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15"/>No kashitwotssh wotowa t'afitwotssh wotowa Krstosn Ik'osh sheeng sháák'o detsts it'anok'o noone. <verse eid="2CO 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16"/>Ikosh k'iro maants jishit k'iri sháák' noone, k'oshosh kasho maants jishit kashi sháák' noone, beré finansh bodts wotituwo kone? <verse eid="2CO 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17"/>Noo Ik' aap'tso jaak k'ac' kemiru ayuwotsk'o noonaliye, ernmó Ik'oke wosheets kááw woshetswotsk'o wotar Krstosn Ik' shinatse keewituwone.<verse eid="2CO 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3"/>
  <para style="s">Handr taari gútsuwots</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1"/>Ando aani notooko údo tuuwwonoowa? Himo ik ikuwots bok'aliruwok'o itsh wee itoke noon tep'osh guut'etso noosh geyiyifek'úna? <verse eid="2CO 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2"/>Ash jamo b́ dantswotsnat b́ nababirwotsn nonibots guut'ts dabdabewwots itne. <verse eid="2CO 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:12">Kesh. 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">Erm. 31:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:19">Hzk'. 11:19</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:26">36:26</ref> </char></note> It no finon daatsets Krstos dabdabewotsi it wottsok'o daneke, woshanuwere b́ guut'e beyat beyiru Ik' shayirona bako k'elemiyonaliye, manuwere ash nibatsa bako gashets shúts tabtabats gut'ekaliye.<verse eid="2CO 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4"/>Hanowere no etir Krstos weeron Ik'atse nodetsts imnetiyoshe. <verse eid="2CO 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5"/>Ik keewonwor nowooke b́wottsok'o gawosh flratsone, manwere eegoshe nonotokon bodknoonaliye, ernmó noon bodtswotsi woshtso Ik'oniye. <verse eid="2CO 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 31:31">Erm. 31:31</ref> </char></note> Handr taarosh finirwotsi nowotitwok'o noon falitso bíne, hanuwere fidelon guut'ets nemon b́woteraniyere S'ayin shayiri tep'one, fidelon guut'ets nemo ud'itkee, S'ayin shayironmó kash imetke.<verse eid="2CO 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7"/>Nemo fideliyon gashdek't guut'e shúts tabtabatse b́ teshi, nemo imeyori shááno k'aawe'efe bíamiri wotiyaloru Israe'el ashuwots Muse shiitso t'iwints de s'iilo falatsno boteshi, eshe k'ir dowet nemo hank'o mangon b́ be'eyal <verse eid="2CO 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8"/>bére, S'ayin Shayiri weeron daatset fino bog mango deetsalkeya? <verse eid="2CO 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9"/>Ashuwotsats morr doots fino hank'o mango b́ detsiyakon ashuwots bín kááw bowotit fino aawuk'oneya bog mango b́ t'ut'eti? <verse eid="2CO 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10"/>Ilts mango ayidek't bog b́wottsatse tuutson beshts mango eegoru b́ berawok'o tawetwe. <verse eid="2CO 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11"/>Ili t'afitwonworu hank'o mango b́ detsiyakon, dúre dúrosh kúp'ar beet keewonmó aawuk'oneya bog mango b t'ut'eti!<verse eid="2CO 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12"/>Hank'o jangetso nodetstsosh ááwu shúk'on keewitwone. <verse eid="2CO 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 34:33">Kesh. 34:33</ref> </char></note> Muse múk'efere amiru b́ shiits golo b́ t'affetsosh Israe'el ashuwots bo be'awok'o b́ shiitso b́ ipefoni b́ teshi, nooyere Musek'o noonaliye. <verse eid="2CO 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14"/>Bo nibo arikon dúnguwtsere, andish b́ borfetso nat taari mas'aafo bo nababor bonibo manoori ipetsmann ipetsok'one b́fa'oni. Ipman ipalon b́wotit Krstos s'uzn b́ wottsotsne. <verse eid="2CO 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15"/>Hambetsish b́ borfetsosh nemi mas'fo nababeyi taawo bonibo ipeyirumann ipeke. <verse eid="2CO 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 34:34">Kesh. 34:34</ref> </char></note> Ernmó asho doonzo maants bíaanor «Ipeyiruman k'ayb́tuwiti.» <verse eid="2CO 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17"/>Doonzo shayire, doonzo shiyiri beyokonowere s'ayin kesho fa'ee. <verse eid="2CO 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18"/>Noo noúnets iperaw shiits wotar doonzo mango mestawtotse bek'eyirwok'o bek'irwone, Shayir wottso doonzo aro aroosh mangoniyere mango maants wonetuwone.<verse eid="2CO 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4"/>
  <para style="s">Arik wosheets fino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1"/>Ik'o b́ mhretwon bísh finet finan noosh b́imtsotse maac'o k'ut'r shuuts aaneratsone. <verse eid="2CO 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2"/>Aashtsonat jitsik wotts keewo juuk'rerone, nemi gondon fineratsone, Ik'i aap'ono kooton woniratsone, dab iki ariko sháánatse nokitsiri, notook jangoshmo ash jami nibots Ik'i shinatse ariko keewitwone. <verse eid="2CO 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3"/>No danits doo shishi aap'o dab ááshka wotiyal bíáásh t'afitwotsshee. <verse eid="2CO 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4"/>Datsani keewiru shed'ano amaneraw ashuwots níbo deekk'rere, mannowere Ik'i aron be'eetso Krstos b́mangi dooshishiyon boosh b́sháánits shááno bobea'awok'o b́woshi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5"/>Noo nodaniyirwo Iyesus Krstos doonz b́wotonat noowere notookon Iyesus jangosh it guuts nowottsok'oni bako notooko nabratsone. <verse eid="2CO 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Aze. 1:3</ref> </char></note> «Shááno t'aluwotse shááne!» ett keewts Ik'o Krstos aron goliruwo Ik'i mango dani shááno noosh b́ imetwok'o b́ shááno nonibots b́ sháánetwok'o woshre.<verse eid="2CO 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7"/>Ernmó jamoniyere bogts angaan Ik'oka bako nok b́woterawotse mangts keewan shali k'ac'ok'o wotdek'at detsdek'rone. <verse eid="2CO 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8"/>B́ kaat kaaton gond bek'o noats bodiruwe, ernmó da'eratsone, ayoto daandirwonee, ernmó maac'o k'ut'ratsone. <verse eid="2CO 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9"/>Giishefoone, ernmó noon shuntswotsi t'ud' danaknone, togeere dihfoone erenmó k'irraknoone, <verse eid="2CO 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10"/>Iyesus kasho no atsotse b́be'etuwok'o Iyesus ats bodts k'iro noatsatsowere jam aawo kurdek'aatniye nogúúriri. <verse eid="2CO 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11"/>Iyesus kasho noats k'irituwanitse b́be'etuwok'o no kashetswots Iyesus jangosh jam aawo beshat noimeyiri. <verse eid="2CO 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12"/>Mansh k'iro noyitse, kasho ityitse b́ finiri.<verse eid="2CO 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 116:10">Dub. 116:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Wotowa eré «Taa amanere, manshe tkeewiri» ett guut'etsok'on, noowere imneti ikman shayiro nodetstsotsene no amaniri, manshowerowe keewirwone. <verse eid="2CO 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14"/>Doonzo Iyesusi k'irotse tiztso Izar Izewer nonowere Iyesusnton b́ tizituwok'onat itntonwere noon b́ shinats b́ t'intsituwok'o danfone. <verse eid="2CO 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15"/>Jaman it t'k'imiyosh wotts s'aato s'eent b́ ooyefetsosh ay ashuwotssh b́ bodtsi taawon Ik' mangosh wotit údo bí ayituwok'owe.<verse eid="2CO 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Imnetiyon beyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16"/>Mansh no maac'o k'ut'ratsone, úratsi noaro b́ t'afiyaloru gitsitsi no atso aawu aawon handr wotituwe <verse eid="2CO 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17"/>Keet wotts gond bek' andish nodek'irwan s'uu deshaw ayidek't een wotts dúre dúri mango noosh daatsituwe. <verse eid="2CO 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18"/>Noo nokotirwo be'eraw keewoni bako be'eyirwoniyaliye, be'eyirwo andkee, be'erawonmó dúre dúrikoniye.<verse eid="2CO 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1"/>And gofok'o wotts datsatsi nomeetso b́gahor ash kishon b́ woterawo Ik'on ageets dúre dúri beyoko darotse nodetstsok'o danfone. <verse eid="2CO 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2"/>Andi beshit gofanitse nobeyor kashe no k'ushiri. <verse eid="2CO 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3"/>Mansh no meets datsatsan b́k'alewor araats wotaarr datseratsone. <verse eid="2CO 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4"/>Arikon k'iritwo kashots b́k'ot'etwok'o tahdek'osha bako noatse giinbazeyo no shunaawotse noo daritsi atso han abaats dabde'er tahdek'o geefone, mansh datsatsi dunkaniyotse fa'uwots noo noats b́mangre kasho nok'as'iri. <verse eid="2CO 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5"/>Keewansh noon k'anitso Ik'oniye, maniyere bog keewo noosh b́ imetu jamosh agito b́ wotish b́ shayiro noosh imtso bíne.<verse eid="2CO 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6"/>Datsatse no atson no befetsosh doonzo'atse no woktsok'o no danaloru jam aawo bín amanetuwone. <verse eid="2CO 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7"/>No nobeyir amanona bako keewwotsi bek'onaliye. <verse eid="2CO 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8"/>No beewok wotts meetsanitsere k'aleyar doonzonton wotoshe no tewniri, mansh amanon beetuwone. <verse eid="2CO 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9"/>No meetsanton nowotiyal wee bíyatse no k'aleyal no k'os'ó doonzo geneúshe. <verse eid="2CO 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10"/>Datsatsi beyon nok'altso gond wotowa doo keewosh ik iko b́ finok'o b́ k'auntso dek'osh noúnets Krstos angshi jori shinats t'ino noosh geyife.<verse eid="2CO 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11"/>Doonzo shato eeg b́wottsok'o no dantsosh, ashuwotssh sheenga err bodek'etwok'o woshitwone, no eeg nowotok'o Ik'o danfee, itwere it nibotse eeg nowotok'o it danetuwok'o jangirwe. <verse eid="2CO 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12"/>Nibotse beyiruwon b́ woterawo be'eyiruwon it'iruwotssh aaniyo it falituwok'o noon it it'etuwok'o itsh gowo imetuwone bako aani no itsh notooko úderatsone. <verse eid="2CO 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13"/>Geetsuwotsi no wotiyalowere Ik'osha etaatniye nogeyi, nibetsuwotsi woterone wotiyalowere itsha etaatniye nibetsuwotsi nowoti. <verse eid="2CO 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14"/>Manjangosh Krstos shuno noon detsetwe. Iko jametsosh b́k'irre jametsotswotswere bok'iro dandek'roone. <verse eid="2CO 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15"/>Kashon fa'a jamwots boosh k'irtsonat k'irotse tuutsosh bobeetuwok'owa bako haniyak botookosha err boberawok'o Krstos jametswotsshowere k'irre.<verse eid="2CO 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16"/>Haniyere okoon noo asho konnor meetsi s'iil s'iilon s'iilatsone, haniyere shin Krstosnor nos'iil ash jamikok'o meetsi s'iil s'iilona wotiyal shinomaants han k'alratsone. <verse eid="2CO 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17"/>Mansh eshe asho konuwor wotowa Krstos jiro b́wotiyal handr azeeke, nattso beshwtseree, jamonu handr wotwtsere. <verse eid="2CO 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18"/>Jamhan b́wotuwere noon b́ tookonton Krstosn manitsonat maniyi fino noosh imts Ik'one. <verse eid="2CO 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19"/>Hanuwere Ik'o Krstosn datsatsi ashjamo b́tookonton maniree etee, bo naandonowere boats taawratse, nooshowere asho doonzonton nomaniyish bí aap'o noosh imre.<verse eid="2CO 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20"/>Ik'o ashuwotsi noweeron b́ s'egetwotse Krstos shegro wotat wosherone, mansh «Ik'onton manewere!» err Krstos shútson itn k'onitwone <verse eid="2CO 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21"/>Noo Krstosn Ik' kááw fino kayituwotsi nowotitwok'o Ik'o morr deshawo Krstosi no morrosh wosho b́wotitwok'o b́ k'ali.<verse eid="2CO 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1"/>Ik'onton tohaat finirwotsi nowottsotse itdek'ts s'aato datsmec'ron oorik'r k'ayere etaat itn k'oniruwe. <verse eid="2CO 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Isa. 49:8</ref> </char></note> Ik'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">«Taash wotts aawots nkeewo k'ebre!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">Kashiyi aawotsowere neen tep'ree!» bí etirwotse</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">«Eshe hambe! wotts aawo andee, kashi aawonwere andee.»<verse eid="2CO 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3"/>No fino k'efeerawok'o ik keewon konshor t'ugo woteratsone. <verse eid="2CO 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4"/>Maniyere gond bek'ona, ono bek'ono, k'ic'onowere k'amefetsr Ik'osh finirwotskok'o notooko jam weeron t'intsituwone. <verse eid="2CO 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Wosh. 16:23</ref> </char></note> Ik'osh fintsuwotsi nowoto nokitsitwere jot'ewon, tipewon, noats tuuzeyiru dimbiron, finon maawon, tokr t'ut'onat s'oomiyonee, <verse eid="2CO 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6"/>Mank'owere s'ayinon, danon, k'amoon, doowoton, S'ayin shayiron jisheewonat bíats daro bítse aalts shunon, <verse eid="2CO 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7"/>ari aap'onat Ik' angone. Bín da'osh wotowa noatse k'arbazosh kes'i kac' wotts kááw fino no k'anonat giri kishon deshdek'etwone. <verse eid="2CO 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8"/>Mangosh wee ketosh, k'orewosh wee údewosh k'an dek'k noone, aretswotsi nowotefere, dirshtswotsi eteyi. <verse eid="2CO 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9"/>Danetswotsi wotefetsat danerawwotskok'o nowoti, k'irrne etefere hamb kashetswotsi wotat nodatseyri, no jot'eyaloru úd'eratsone, <verse eid="2CO 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10"/>Shiyano noats b́ bodaloru jam aawo geneúituwone, tuguretswotsi wotefetsat ayuwotsi gaaletso nowoshiri, eegoru deshawwots wotefetsat, jam keewo detsfone.<verse eid="2CO 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11"/>It K'orotosn beyiru ashuwotso! hamb, itsh kish dek'at keewurone, no nibonowere gawintsdek'at itsh k'eshrone. <verse eid="2CO 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12"/>Itna itshuno noosh baziyi bako no itsh bayatsone. <verse eid="2CO 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13"/>Niho b́nana'úwotssh b́keewfok'o tkeewre, noo nonibo gawunon k'eshde'er nogitsotse shisheyirwo itsh kish nokitstsok'o itwere mank'o noosh k'aluwere.<verse eid="2CO 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amaneraw ashuwotsnton ikwotk'azo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14"/>Woteraw finon, amaneraw ashuwotsnton ikn s'andek'ayere, kááwonat morron awuk'o k'alrniya ikwoto bofaliti? Sháánonat t'aluwon towaar beyo aawk'oneya bofaliti? <verse eid="2CO 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15"/>Krstosnat Diyablosn aawuk'oneya ik woto bofaliti? Amantsonat amanerawonmó aawuk'oneya kod'ewo bofaliti? <verse eid="2CO 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lew. 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Hzk'. 37:27</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 K'or. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:19">6:19</ref> </char></note> Ik'i maa S'ayino woteraw dozets ik'uwotsnton eeg ikwote b́detsi? Ik'onwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">«T beyokonowere tiashuwots taalots woshituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">Bontonwere beetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">Taa boosh boko Izar Izeweri wotituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">Bowere ti ashuwotsi wotitúne»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:16">ett b́ keewtsok'on no beyat beyiru Ik'osh S'ayin Ik' maa noone. <verse eid="2CO 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Isa. 52:11</ref> </char></note> Manats dabt doonzo hank'o etre,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">«Bo dagotse galeyar keere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">Kim wotts keewo t'awik'ayere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">Taawere iti dek'etuwe,<verse eid="2CO 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1 Zen. 17:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:6">Isa. 43:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">Erm. 31:9</ref> </char>
    </note> Taawere itnihi wotituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Itwere t nungush nana'úwotsnat mááts nanaúwotsi wotitute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Etre jam faltso Izar Izeweri.»<verse eid="2CO 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1"/>Tmashotso! jam keewo jangit noosh imetsotse atsonat shayiron kimshit kon naari keewatse notooko s'ayitsuwone, Ik' shatoon S'ayin nowoto s'een b́ wotituwok'o woshwone.<verse eid="2CO 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos gene'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2"/>It nibon noon de'ere, no konnoru daderatsone, konatsor gondo fineratsone, dirshon konatsno ik jago geeratsone. <verse eid="2CO 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3"/>Hano t etir itats angshoshaliye. Haniye shini itsh tkeewtsok'o it no nibots itne, eshe kashon wotowa k'iron jam aawo itatse k'aleratsone. <verse eid="2CO 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4"/>Itatse tdetsts imnetiyo eene, itatse tdetsts it'o eene, kup'wtsere, nokic' jamon ayide geneúituwe.<verse eid="2CO 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5"/>Mek'edoniyots nobodiyakon ay kaaton gondbek'a no atsats bodi bako kash dek'o iknotonor daatsratsone, úratse fayo gitsotsnowere shate nodetsi. <verse eid="2CO 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6"/>Ernmó juweetswotsi kup'shit Ik'o Izar Izewer Tito b́woon noon kup'shre. <verse eid="2CO 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7"/>Nokup'uwere b́ waats mec'rosh b́woterawo it bín it kup'shtso noshishtsotsne, t jangosh it detsts mirac'o, shiyanonat tjangosh it kic'irwok'o noosh b́keewre iki tgeneúwi.<verse eid="2CO 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8"/>Haniyere shin itsh t guut'ts wosho itn shiyaanik b́wotiyalor dab woshman tguut'tsotse goyineraatse, goyinere wotiyalowere tgoyin twoshon múk'na'a gizewosh itn tshiyanitsotsne. <verse eid="2CO 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9"/>Andmó gene'owere, tgene'útsonuwere eegoshe itn tshiyanitsosh b́woterawon it shiyantsatse tuutson naandrone etaat itwonetsotsne, eshe it shiyano Ik'o ettsok'o b́wottsotse no itn eegor daderatsone etee. <verse eid="2CO 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10"/>Ik'o ettsok'on wotts shiyano woro maants jishituwo naandre eton daatset wonewo b́daatsitwotse goyino dooratse, datsatsi shiyanonmó k'ire b́doweti. <verse eid="2CO 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11"/>It shiyaanan Ik' ettsok'on b́wottsok'owo awuk'o kup'de fino, awuk'o wotts aniyidek'o, awuk'o kááron fayo, awuk'o shato, awuk'o mirac'o, awuk'o okooro, awuk'o sezonowere b́dootsok'owo nibnde'er t'iwintsde s'iilere. Ando it jam keewon s'ayin it wottsok'o gawon gawirute.<verse eid="2CO 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12"/>Itsh t guut'alor taa itsh tguut' no jangosh itdetsts kup'ar fino Ik'o shinatse itsh shaanr b́daneetwok'owa etaatni bako morro bín dadets ashosha etaatniyaliye. <verse eid="2CO 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13"/>Jamanatse tuutson noo kup'erone, no nokup'tsoniyere bogo ando Tito b́daatsts geneúwon iki ayidek'at geneeúweroone, manu eegishe b́shayirosh kashdek'o itdatsitsoshe. <verse eid="2CO 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14"/>It atse t detsts it'onowere Titosh keewre b́teshi, itwere taan jitsiratste, jam aawo itsh arikeewono itsh keewufoone b́teshi, hanuwere it jango Titosh nokeewtso itn it'o arbwotoon be'ere. <verse eid="2CO 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15"/>It únetswor azazeyirwotsi itwottsotsnat shatoonat k'ewon bín itdek'tsok'owo Tito b́gawor itsh b́detsts shuno ayidek't eeno wotere. <verse eid="2CO 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16"/>Taawere jam weeron itn it'o tfaltsotse iki bogshdek' geneúwere.<verse eid="2CO 7:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8"/>
  <para style="s">Krstiyaniyots tewdo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1"/>T eshuwotso! Ik'o Mek'odonin fa'a Ik' maa moowwotssh bí imts s'aato itsh daniyo shunfone. <verse eid="2CO 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2"/>Bowere ay gond bek'on faderne, b́woteferoru bogen'úo ayidek't eene, ayidek't tugurtswotsi bo wotiyaloru dab een teudo woshrne. <verse eid="2CO 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3"/>Bo faltsok'onat bofaltsoniyere bogo bo shunon bo imtsok'o taa boosh gawitwe, <verse eid="2CO 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1-4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:26">Rom 15:26</ref> </char></note> Yhud datsatse beyiru Kirstiyaniwots ash tep'i gowo boosh baziyerawok'o kup'idek't noon bok'oni. <verse eid="2CO 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5"/>Bowere bo k'oltso no nokotirwoniyere boge, shin shin botoko doonzosh boimi, manats dabtnu Ik' shunok'on botoko noosh imrne. <verse eid="2CO 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6"/>Finan shin shinon fintso Titoyi b́ wottsotse andoor bo teudi finan s'uwaats de'am b́ betsitwok'o bín k'onitwe <verse eid="2CO 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7"/>It imnetiyon, noon keew keewon, danon, kup'on, nooke dan itdek'ts shunon jam keewono bogfte, tewd dooyi finannowere it bogetwok'o wotowe.<verse eid="2CO 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8"/>Eshe, tietir azazonaliye, ernmó k'oshuwots imon kup' woto it kup' wotonton no nohir it shuno ar b́ woto shu'ar s'iilosha etaatniye. <verse eid="2CO 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9"/>It no doonz Iyesus Krstos s'aato danfte bí eegoru dab gaaletsk b́ wotiyaloru bí tugurets wotat it galetswotsi it wotituwok'o itsha ett tugretsk b́ woti.<verse eid="2CO 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10"/>Han jagosh itsh sheeng araat be'ets izo itsh imetwe, beshts dúron im mec'r b́ woterawo han k'alosh shini geetswots itne b́ teshi. <verse eid="2CO 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11"/>Eshe imosh it detsts shúno finats jitsit s'uwo maants b́ bodetwok'o it faltsok'on it gawts man and k'aluwere. <verse eid="2CO 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12"/>Imosh sheeng shun detstso b́ beyal ashman tewdi doon b́ detstso b́ imala boko bíangalon b́ímíshaliye.<verse eid="2CO 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13"/>Hanowere ti etir it únets taalo it wotitwok'owa bako it imon it kic'efere k'oshwots bín kash bodek'isha etaatniyaliye <verse eid="2CO 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14"/>It it kic'or bogizo it kic'ats b́ jinetwok'o and it gizo bok'ic'ats jinee, hank'on it dagotse manuts woto beetwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Kesh. 16:18</ref> </char></note> Hanwere, «Ayi ko'itswotssh oreratse, múk' ko'itswotsshowere shapratse» ett guut'etsok'one.<verse eid="2CO 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Titonat b́tohuwotsn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16"/>Taa itsh t shiyanirwok'o Titowere itsh b́ nibon b́ shiyanituwok'o woshts Ik'o údewe. <verse eid="2CO 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17"/>Tito it maants b́weet b́ took shunon tuut gene'ona bako no nok'onts mec'roshaliye. <verse eid="2CO 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18"/>Doo shishiy nabon Ik'maa jamooke údetso eshúwo bínton woshitwone. <verse eid="2CO 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19"/>Haniyere dambon eshuwan no sheeng finan doonzo mangosh nofinorat finosh nodetsts sheeng shuno nokitsor noonton amt nofiinman b́ tep'etwok'o Ik'i moowwots n marat'etsoniye.<verse eid="2CO 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20"/>Tewdi doon imets gizan nok'eezor noshútso b́ t'afrawok'o no atso kordek'etwone. <verse eid="2CO 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 3:4">Ari. 3:4</ref> </char></note> Noo nogeyiru keewo doonzo shinatse s'uz b́woterawo ashuwots shinatse kááw wotts keewo k'ale.<verse eid="2CO 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22"/>Ayoto ay weeron fadere kup'at fintso wotat daatsetso no'eshuwi Titowi bonton woshitwone, bí itatse b́detsts imnetiyo een b́wottsotse and finann iti tep'osh b́detsts kup'at fino awurtsooniyere boge. <verse eid="2CO 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23"/>Tito jango dano b́geyitka wotiyal itn tep'osh taanton finirwo, fini weeron ttohe, bínton tohaat weyiru k'oshwots jango b́wotiyalowere bo Ik'i moowwotsatse naashuwots, Krstos mangosh need'tswotsiye. <verse eid="2CO 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24"/>Mansh it shúno boosh kitswere, hank'on it shunonat itatse nodetsts it'o k'awtsalko b́ woterawok'o Ik'i maa jamwotssh kitsitute.<verse eid="2CO 8:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9"/>
  <para style="s">Krstiyaniwotssh kisheets gizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1"/>Yhuditse fa'a krstiyaniwotssh kisheet gizi jango itsh guut'o taan geyiratse, <verse eid="2CO 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2"/>«Akayiy dats ashuwots natstsoon tuut tep'osh k'andek'kne» etaat mek'edoniitsi ashuwotsoke it jangosh ti ít'ir it kup'ar it finitwok'o t dantsoshe, it kup'at itfiintsonwere k'oshwotsnoor tuuzere. <verse eid="2CO 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3"/>Keewanatse itatse no detsts it'o dats mec'ro wotar b́oorerawok'o eeshwanotsi woshiirwe, itwere ari taa haniyere shin ti ettsok'o k'ande'er korere. <verse eid="2CO 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4"/>Mek'edoni dats ashuwots taanton itok waarr itk'ande'aawo bodatsiyal itats noit'tsatse tuutson jiitsitwone, itmó ayde'erniye itjiitsiti. <verse eid="2CO 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5"/>Mansha imetuwone it etts tewud doon it imiruwo it k'aniyitwok'o itsh bogawitwok'owa etaat eshwaanots taayere shino itok boweetwok'o wosho b́ geyiko b́wottsok'o daatsre, mank'oon taa twoor tewudi dowon it imetuwo k'anke b́wotiti, itwere it imet angnon b́woterawo shunon b́wottsok'owoniye b́kitsiti.<verse eid="2CO 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6"/>«Múk'shde shooketwo muk'e b́kakuwiti, ay shooktso aye b́ ko'iyiti» ett keewetso gawde'ere. <verse eid="2CO 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7"/>Eshe Ik'o b́shunfo geneúwon imet asho b́wottsotse asho ik ikon b́nibotse imosh b́geetso shunr ima bako shiyaanefetsr wee b́maac'otse aalo imk'aye. <verse eid="2CO 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8"/>Jam aawo jamkeewon it tooko falr shengfiinats jinosh itfalitwok'o ayide b́ deero itsh imo falfe. <verse eid="2CO 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9"/>«Hanwere t'owwotssh tewdi dowon imre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">B́ kááw finonwere dúre dúrosh beetuwe»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 9:9">et t guut'etsok'one.<verse eid="2CO 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10"/>Shooko shooktsosh, moowosh misho imirwo Izar Izewer it shooket shooko ayde'er imetwe, it kááwi shuwonowere itsh ayituwe. <verse eid="2CO 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11"/>It tewdi doo noweeron boosh b́bodiru ash jamwots Ik'o bo úditwok'o jam aawo it imetwok'o Ik'o jam keewon iti deritwe. <verse eid="2CO 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12"/>It kaliru tewdi finan krstiyaniyots kic'otse kishoniyere bogo ashuwots Ik'osh ay udo bot'intsitwok'o woshitwe. <verse eid="2CO 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13"/>It tewdi dowi finann Krstos doo shishiyo dek'at bísh azazetswotsi itwottsok'onat, bonat k'oshwotsnsh tewdi doo kitsosh b́ wottsotse jametswots Ik'o úditúne. <verse eid="2CO 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14"/>It atse fa'a s'eent kud'ts Ik'i s'aatatse tuutson itjangosh Ik'o k'onfetsr itn gawitune. <verse eid="2CO 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15"/>Ash noon keewon keewosh falerawo bí imtsosh Ik'o údeek wotowe.<verse eid="2CO 9:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos b́finijangosh aani b́de'ktsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1"/>Taa P'awlos it shinats twotor ááwu nefe eteyiri, itokere tworomó ááwu shúk'e eteyiri, Krstos doowootonat maac'nefon iti k'onirwe, <verse eid="2CO 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2"/>Meets ettsok'on no sha'irwok'o woshdek't taawiru ik ik ashuwots shinatse ááw shuuk'on keewo t geeyiyaloru itok twoor ááw shuk'on t keewitwok'o k'alk'ayere. <verse eid="2CO 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3"/>Dab datsanatse no beyaloru nokaarit datsatsi kaaraliye. <verse eid="2CO 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4"/>No kes' k'ac'onwere ááshet gop'o gaak faliyit Ik' ang detstswoni bako datsanatsi kes' k'ac'wotsiliye. <verse eid="2CO 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5"/>Ik'o danosh t'ug wotar tuwit mooshonat míshon gaaketwone, asaabi jamono k'aa'uder Krstossh bíaletwok'o woshitwone. <verse eid="2CO 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6"/>It aleyo s'een b́wotor konnari alek'azono sezosh k'andek'tswotsi wotitwone.<verse eid="2CO 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7"/>It its'iilirwo úratse bek'eyiru keewo s'uziye, asho konwor wotowa Krstosk taane ett bíatso amanirwo aanide'er t'iwintswe, noowere bíkok'o Krstosk nowottsok'o dande'e. <verse eid="2CO 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8"/>Doonzo noosh b́imts alon ayide'er ti it'alor bín jitseratse, alan noosh ime iti agosha bako gaakoshaliye. <verse eid="2CO 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9"/>T woshon itn t shatiyirwok'o ark'ye itsha. <verse eid="2CO 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10"/>Ik ikuwots «P'awlos woshwots mangtswotsnat kup'knee, bí b́tookon noonton b́wotormó maawke, b́ noon keew keewonwere k'awntsalke» etiirunee. <verse eid="2CO 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11"/>Man etiru ashuwots noo wokoon wotdek'at nowoshtswotsitse noguut'irwonat t karnonowere itnton wotdek'at nofiiniruwi dagotse k'osh k'osho b́beerawok'owo dande'ene.<verse eid="2CO 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12"/>B́ wotefere botoko údiru ash ik ikwotsnton no tooko nohiwosh wee notooko nuutsir s'iilosh ááwo shu'atsone, bomó botoko botookonton botatstsonat botookonowere botookonton bonohitsotse t'iwints dek'knaliye. <verse eid="2CO 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13"/>Noomó dab itok no borfetso Ik'o noosh b́ imts fini gúúron it'etuwoone bako tatsoniyere dambo id'atsone. <verse eid="2CO 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14"/>It beyruwere nofiiniru gúúrots b́wottsotse Krstos dooshishiyo daniyoh itok nowoor gúúrmaniyere besheratsone. <verse eid="2CO 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15"/>Mansha Ik'o noosh b́beezts gúúroniyere beshar k'oshwots finon weeralo id'atsone, maniyeremó it imnetiyo b́daboor Ik'o noosh b́beezts gúúrotse noon it mangitwok'o tewnirwone. <verse eid="2CO 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16"/>Eshe k'osh ashi fini gúúrots kindr shin fiinets finon noid'awo itiyere oke fa'a datswotsatse bíko doo shishi aap'o shishiyosh falfone.<verse eid="2CO 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JER 9:24">Erm. 9:24</ref> </char>
    </note> Ernmó «It'etwo doonzon id'ee.» <verse eid="2CO 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18"/>Asho údewosh b́bodet doonzo bín b́údora bako b́tooko b́tookon b́údoraliye.<verse eid="2CO 10:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlosnat kootets woshetswotsn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1"/>Taa muk'i dog t wottsotse taash it k'amitwok'o jangirwe, oona! taash k'amde'ere. <verse eid="2CO 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2"/>Baarna'a s'eenu ikukok'o iti kenih iko Krstossh twid'tsotse, Ik'i okooron okoorirwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-5">Aze. 3:1-5</ref> </char></note> Dawunzo Hewaani weeri gondon b́ sheelitsok'o daneraka it asaabiyonwere awaashwtsar Krstossh itdetsts okooronat s'ayinon wottso it amanewo k'ayk'ritute etaat shatirwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4"/>Ik asho itok waar no nó nabtso b́woterawo k'osh Iyesusi itsh b́nabiyal wee it itdek'ts shayiro b́woteraniyere k'osh shayiro itdek'al, wee it dek'ts doo shishiyo b́ woterawo k'osh doo shishiyo it dek'al, s'k etaatni it dek'i etee.<verse eid="2CO 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5"/>Ernmó taa een een woshetswotsiyere jam keewon tdashtsok'o areratse. <verse eid="2CO 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6"/>Noon keewon dantso woto tk'azaloru dab dano taash shapatse, hanowere ayoto ay weeron kishdek' itsh danirone.<verse eid="2CO 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7"/>Taa Ik'i doo shushiyo itsh k'awntsalon tnabonat itn dambaan tizosh t tooko dashan t detso morrok'oweya b́ taaweyiri? <verse eid="2CO 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8"/>Itsh finosh k'osh Ik' moowwotsoke tep'o dek'at boon biik're. <verse eid="2CO 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:15-18">Filp. 4:15-18</ref> </char></note> Itnton tbeyor taash wotit keewo b shapor, Mek'odoniyon waats t eshwots taash geyits jam keewon botep'irwotse konatsoru kuro woteratse, andish b́ borfetsosh itats jam keewon kuro woteratse, shino maantsisho kuro woteratse. <verse eid="2CO 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10"/>Krstos arikeewo t gitsotse b́ beyirwtse hanatse tuutson t id'awok'o woshitwo Akayiyi datsatse konworu aaliye. <verse eid="2CO 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11"/>B́ jango eebi? Itn shuno tk'ztsosheya? Itn tshuntsok'o Ik'o danfee.<verse eid="2CO 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12"/>K'osh wosheets manots, «No bonk'o finirwone» err boit'et weero t'ut'iyosh and tk'alirwok'o shino maantsoru dab k'alituwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13"/>Hank'o ashaanots Krstossh woshetswotsi aroosh botook wonawoniru kootets woshetswotsnat ash ant'elcef finetswotsiye. <verse eid="2CO 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14"/>Hanwere adiyit keewaliye, shed'anonworu dab shááno melakiwotsi aroosh b́ tooko b́woniti. <verse eid="2CO 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15"/>Mansh eshe shed'anosh finirwots kááwosh finirwotsi aroosh bo tooko bowoniyal noon adiratse, s'uwatse bo fini k'awntso daatsitune.<verse eid="2CO 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos wosheetso b́wottsosh bíyats bodts kic'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16"/>«Asho konwor dartso twottsok'o bísh ark'aye» err aani keewituwe. Dartsi twotiyaloru dab múk'i t it'etwok'o dartsok'o woshde'er taan taawwore. <verse eid="2CO 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17"/>Hank'o it'on tkeewor t keewirwo doonzo shunok'o b́ woterawo dartsok'o wotatniye. <verse eid="2CO 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18"/>Aywots meets keewon bo it'iruwosh taawor it'etuwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19"/>It t'iwintsirwotsi it wottsok'on dartswots jangosh gene'on k'amitute. <verse eid="2CO 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20"/>Hank'o konworu guutsok'o itn b́ woshiyal, konworu itko b́maal, iti b́finiyal, iti b́gac'iyal, it malalats b́ jabiyal k'amitute. <verse eid="2CO 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21"/>Taan jitsitka wotiyaloru dab keewanotsi finosh kup'uwotsi wotnok'azo itsh kitsitwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ernmó konwor it'osh ááwo b́ shúk'ol taaworu bíkok'o ááwo shúk'twe, hanowere ti etir and dartsok'o wotatniye. <verse eid="2CO 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22"/>Bo Ibrawi ashnowa? Taawere Ibrawi ash taane, bo Israe'el ashnowa? Taawere Israe'el ash taane, bo Abraham naarnowa? Taawere Abraham naar taane. <verse eid="2CO 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:23">Wosh. 16:23</ref> </char></note> Bo Krstos guutsnowa? Taawere boyere bogo Krstossh guuts taane, hanowere ti etor geyetsok'o wotatniye t keewiri, boyere bogo ayoto finon mawure, ayoto tipere, ayoto jot'ere, ayoto k'iri t'up'er tawats bodre, <verse eid="2CO 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24"/>Útsoti shaashe jeed'iyoto ayhudiwots k'ac'eyon jot'ere, <verse eid="2CO 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:22">Wosh. 16:22</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:19">14:19</ref> </char></note> Keezoto gúmbon jot'ere, iknoto shútson k'is'ere, keezoto markabotse t'up'er tawo tiyats bodre, ik t'úwonat ik aawon aats k'aratse t teshi, <verse eid="2CO 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Wosh. 9:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:15">14:15</ref> </char></note> T sha'i ayon foki s'eenonat aats di'on, biik'irwotsn bik'ewo ti'ats bodre, Ayhudi jirwotsnat Ik' ash woterawotsokere t'up'er tawo tiyats bodre, Kitonat worwotse aats k'aratsnowere t'up'er tawo tiyats bodre, mank'o kootets amantsuwotsoke t'up'ertawo tiyats bodre. <verse eid="2CO 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27"/>Ayo finonat maawo detsfe b́ teshi, ayoto tokro t t'utfoni, k'ak'efe, shashwefe, ayoto mish t'ut'o tiyats bodre, ak'onat araats woto tiyats bodre. <verse eid="2CO 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28"/>K'osh jam keewo t taawoniyere Ik'i moowwotsosh aawu aawon shiyanat t kic'efoni. <verse eid="2CO 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29"/>Maawrawo kone, taawor mááwratsta? ash iko morron b́ dihor taawer nib t k'únaw aawo egore?<verse eid="2CO 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30"/>It'o b́ geyitka wotink'e taa bín ti it'etwo taa maaw ash twoto kitsit keewwotsne, <verse eid="2CO 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31"/>Dúre dúrosh údeek wottso no doonz Iyesus nihi Ik'o t koorawok'o danfee. <verse eid="2CO 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32"/>Demask'o kitotse tbeyor nugúso Aretasiyere dashe dats k'eeziruwo taan detso geeyat kitutse bín keshet weero kotirwotsn b́ kotifere b́ teshi. <verse eid="2CO 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:23-25">Wosh. 9:23-25</ref> </char></note> Wotowa bako ashuwots kas'i tungushi fúri weeron ooshon taan oorsh bok'rere b́ kishotse k'az t keshi.<verse eid="2CO 11:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos bek'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1"/>Dab it'otse daatset keewo b́ t'ut'aloru it'etwe, ernmo and doonzoke tdaatsts bek'onat be'etson keewo shunfee. <verse eid="2CO 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2"/>Krstosk wotts ik asho danfee, ashaan tatse awd natoniyere shinon keezl darok b́ borfetso b́ dek'eyi, b́ dek'ewewere b́ meetsontoni wotowa b́ meeston wot b́k'zo danatse, Ik'o danfee. <verse eid="2CO 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3"/>Ernmó ashaan Geneto maants b́ dek'etsok'o danfone, b́ meetson wotowá wotb́k'azon danatsone, Ik'o danfee, <verse eid="2CO 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4"/>Bíwere Geneto maants dek'eyat ash noon keewon keewosh falerawonat asho keewo b́ falaaw keewo b́ shishi. <verse eid="2CO 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5"/>Hank'o ashonn it'etuwe, t tokoshomó maawuk t wotoniyere okoon k'osh bín ti it'et keewo aaliye. <verse eid="2CO 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6"/>Eshe, taa ariko tkeewirwosh it'o tgeyiyalor dartsi woteratse, ernmó konwor tiatse b́bek'irwonat tiyoke b́k'ebirwoniyere bogshde'er taan b́s'iilawok'owa etaat it'atse tiatso kotdek'irwe.<verse eid="2CO 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7"/>Taash be'ets een een keewanotsatse tuutson t id'awok'o t meetso angitsok'o koshet weesho taash imeyi, hanuwere shed'ani melakiyo wotat taan túúzit onobek'shr ti id'awok'o taan b́woshiti. <verse eid="2CO 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8"/>Taan weeshiru keewan tiatse b́ k'aawu'etwok'o doonzo keezoto t k'oni. <verse eid="2CO 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9"/>Ernmó «Ti ango s'eenon b́fiinit n maaw manits b́wottsotse ts'aato neesh bodfe» taash bíeti, mansh Krstos ango tiats b́wotitwok'o jamoniyre bogo maawk twoton geneúfetsr it'o shunfee <verse eid="2CO 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10"/>Ango t daatsit maawk t wotor b́ wottsotse Krstos jangosh t maawor, t c'ashewor, gondo tbek'or, t gishewor, tkic'oro geneútwe.<verse eid="2CO 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11"/>Doogok'o keewre! eshe hank'o tkeewitwok'o taan k'altswots itne, taan údiyank'wots itna b́teshi, taa daneraw ash twotiyalor dab een eenne eteets woshetswotsiyere eegonor dasheraatse. <verse eid="2CO 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12"/>Ari wosheetso twoto kitsiru keewwots itnton tbewor k'amoon t k'alts fiinwotsiye, milikitanotsnat adits keewanotswere adiknee. <verse eid="2CO 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13"/>It ats kuro wot tk'azoniyere okoon k'osh Ik'i moowwotsiyere iti t dashiyi eegneya? Hanuwere naandok'o b́taawetka wotiyal taash oorowe erere!<verse eid="2CO 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14"/>Itok wosh k'andek' ttuwiyakon han keezloniye, taa itats kuro woto geeratse, taa tgeyir itna bako it gizoniyaliye. Bo nana'osh giz kakuwo b́s'ili ind nihwotsi bako nanaúwots indnihwotssh gizo ko'irakne. <verse eid="2CO 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15"/>Itsha err dab t gizonat t tookon beshide'er t imink'e ayideniye t geneuti, eshe taa itn ayidek'at t shunfere it taan it shunir hank'o múk'sh dek'atneya?<verse eid="2CO 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16"/>Ekewin wotowa hann wotowa taa itsh kuro woteratse, weeri gondonat ant'elcon iti tdetstsok'oye itsh bíari.? <verse eid="2CO 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17"/>T woshts ashuwotsitsere ikon dab kis'o keshrta? <verse eid="2CO 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18"/>Tito it maants b́ weetwok'o t k'oni, no eshu manowere bínton t woshi, eshe, Tito itoke t'k'miyo datsra? Taanat bín itsh nofin ik shayiron woteratsa? No sha sha'onwere ik woteratsa?<verse eid="2CO 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19"/>It únets andish b́ borfetsosh it gawir noo it shinatse notook jangosha etaat aninodek'irwok'o woshdek'aatni k'úna? Noo Krstosn wotdek'at nokeewirwo Ik'o shinaatsne, shuneetswotso! no jaman nokeewir iti kup'iyosha etaatniye. <verse eid="2CO 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20"/>Taa manmaants t woor daneraka it wotish t geyirwok'o it woterawon, taawere it itgeyirwok'o twoterawo gonketwonek'úna etaat shatirwe, mank'o itoke kaareyo, okooro, fayo, tookshuntsi woto, ash shúúts t'afiyo, óóno, bogtaana etonat dimbron beetúne etaat shatirwee. <verse eid="2CO 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21"/>Aani aanar itok twoor tiko Izar Izewer daneraka taan itshinatse ketitwe etaat shatirwe, haniyere shin bofints morratse tuutson kiimo, wido, shiraats jintsi wotatse tuutson naandrone eraaw ashuwots jangatse shiyanots kindiftak'úna etaat shatirwe.<verse eid="2CO 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13"/>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi izonat jamon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 17:6">Iwi. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe, itok twoor han keezloniye taasha, awror b́wotiyal jam keewo arik b́ wotit wee git wee keez gawwotsne. <verse eid="2CO 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2"/>Gitlts s'iilo twoor itnton tteshor it tooko kor itdek'etwok'o keewatniye t teshi, andoor aaniy haniyere shin morro fintswotsnat k'oshwotsshor boatso korbodek'etwok'o keewitwe, and taa itok aanar twoor konshor maac'o k'eweratse, <verse eid="2CO 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3"/>It t gitsotse beyat keewirwo Krstosi b́wottsok'o dandek'oshe itgeyiri, itoke beyrwo b́kúp'a bako b́maawoniyaliye. <verse eid="2CO 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4"/>Bí mask'aliyats jiteyat b́k'ir maawona wotiyalor and Ik'i angon kashone b́ beyiri, noowere bíkok'o maawtswotsi woterone, itnton nodetsts gonkewok'onmó bínton Ik'i angon beetuwone.<verse eid="2CO 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5"/>It amantsatse it kúp'tsok'o sheengsh danosh it tooko t'iwintsde'er s'iilere, it atsono fads'iilere, Iyesus Krstos itgitsots b́wottsok'owo t'iwintsde'atsteya? Mank'o wotob́k'zal fadewor dihrte etee, <verse eid="2CO 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6"/>Noo fadewor nodihrawok'o dan itdek'etwok'owe nojangiri. <verse eid="2CO 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7"/>Gond keewo itk'alrawok'o Ik'o k'onirwone, Ik'o nok'onirwere no took faltswotsi wotat be'erani no'ooriyal it úni aawo sheeng wotts keewo it finitwok'owa bako tooko nofalo kitsoshaliye. <verse eid="2CO 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8"/>Noo ari keewosha nofinri bako ari keewo k'efitwo eegor k'alo falatsonee. <verse eid="2CO 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9"/>Noo maawtswotsi nowotere it kúp'uwotsi it wottsosh gene'úwirwone, no Ik'o nok'onir it s'eenwotsi it wotitwok'owe. <verse eid="2CO 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10"/>Woshan itoke wokdek' befetsat tguut'ir manatse tuutsone, hank'on itok twoor doonzo taash b́ imts alon itn kic'iratse, doonzo alo taash b́ im itn tiagisha bako iti gaakoshaliye.<verse eid="2CO 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11"/>Eshe ti eshúwotso! jamon beewere! it bebeyo manutside'ere, t izonowere beewere, it ats atseyosh ikwotore, jeenon beewere, shunonat jeeniko Izar Izewer itnton wotituwe.<verse eid="2CO 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12"/>S'ayin wotts jobon jobeyar jamo aatewere.<verse eid="2CO 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13"/>Amants jamwots jamo itsh t'intsirune.<verse eid="2CO 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14"/>Doonzo Iyesus Krstos s'aato, Ik' shuno, S'ayin shayro ik woto it únetsnton wotowe.<verse eid="2CO 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13"/>
</usx>
